<title>USA: Ulick to head JP Morgan equity research.</title>
<headline>Ulick to head JP Morgan equity research.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Investment Management Inc named Susan Ulick as director of U.S. equity research.</p>
<p>Ulick was previously the senior equity research analyst for ferrous and non-ferrous metals.  She will keep those responsibilities.</p>
<p>Ulick replaces Keith Banks, who remains head of overall U.S. equity.</p>
<p>Morgan Investment is a unit of J.P. Morgan &amp; Co Inc.</p>
